				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ πένθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cleom.</u>
					22
